                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "The locked panel in Spanish with the selected track's own length (8 compases) and start (1\/8): each row's note names the track's value beside the lock, while the buttons show the defaults they edit (4 compases, Inicio), as decided for #1654 (decision 2: the readout edits the all-tracks default and names the override). The band's sentence is the longest on the panel and still fits on one line at 640 logical. Pairs with 02, the same state seen from the readout's strip."
              }
